<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="b6001c5f">Distinguish between true defects and new requirements, i.e. if it should be considered out of scope for this release.</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="61bc21ce"></attribute>
<attribute name="usageGuidance" nodeId="74b32979"></attribute>
<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="c9cb08fb">&lt;p&gt;
    Review user feedback collected from the software demonstration. Categorize feedback according to the software object
    type, e.g. report, interface, conversion, etc. Additionally, determine if feedback is truly a defect, i.e. an error,
    flaw, failure, or fault in the package application, or if the feedback is out of scope and should be part of a new
    requirement.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
